  "notes": [
    "Declarative deployment checklist, not an automatically consumed CLI schema",
    "No automatic TTL: pending drafts carry cleanupAfter; imports.markExpired discards expired raw material for the authenticated owner",
    "uploadTickets carry cleanupAfter and are released by cleanupOwnerUploads; no deployment timer is configured yet, so expired screenshots are removed on the next owner sweep",
    "providerSettings stores only the sealed keyEnvelope; providerUsage keeps per-day model and OCR counters",
    "Only the API service identity writes these collections; never give clients administrative database credentials",
    "Current mini program uses snapshots as canonical state, including schedules; legacy record APIs are retained but are not a synchronization source."
  ]
}
